WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Welcome to EduConnect Ethiopia.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
EduConnect helps students and families discover schools.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Users can explore schools in different Ethiopian cities.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
